 "title": "Winneshiek County Treasurer - Winneshiek County",
 "text": "Winneshiek County Treasurer - Winneshiek County Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window You are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser or activate Google Chrome Frame to improve your experience.\nView Agenda\nWatch Meetings\nCalendar\nRoad Closures\nFacebook Search for Search\nToggle navigation\nMENU MENU\nAbout Job Opportunities\nDirectory of Services\nCounty Government\nTourism\nDepartments & Offices Administration, Business & Finance Auditor\nBoard of Supervisors\nTreasurer\nCommunity Services Conservation Board\nLandfill\nRecycling\nVeterans\nCounty Social Services\nGovernment Services Auditor\nRecorder\nPlanning & Zoning\nPublic Safety & Legal Attorney\nEmergency Management\nSheriff\nPublic Health Nursing Service\nRoads Engineer\nReal Estate Assessor\nGIS\nEnvironmental Health & Land Use Environmental Health\nBoards & Commissions\nWinneshiek County Treasurer\nHome Departments Winneshiek County Treasurer\nWinneshiek County Treasurer\nThe Treasurer, being a curator for Winneshiek County, is responsible for the receipt, management, disbursement, financial reporting, and investment of all monies paid to the County and serves as agent for the State of Iowa Department of Transportation and Iowa Department of Revenue and Finance.\nThe Treasurer compiles composite reports from individual record books to general ledgers, reviews and reconciles receipts, bills, and cash received to assure accuracy of figures to prevent discrepancies and financial loss. In addition, the Treasurer categorizes, indexes, files and deposits materials, forms and monies received to assure public funds are administered properly.\nThe Treasurer is responsible for the proper receipt, accounting and disbursement of county funds within proper policies established by the State of Iowa, Winneshiek County Board of Supervisors and corporate and unincorporated taxing entities for adequate financial control.\nTo make on-line property tax and vehicle registration payments, go to Iowa treasurers site here .\nWalk-in traffic is allowed for Motor Vehicle and Property Tax transactions . It is also an option to make payments for motor vehicle and property tax transactions by going on-line to www.iowatreasurers.org or by mailing payments to Winneshiek Co Treasurer 201 W Main St Decorah IA 52101 or by putting in the drop off box located outside of the courthouse. Additional fees apply to credit card transactions. E-check fee is .25 Credit Card fee is 2.25%\nDRIVER’S LICENSE TRANSACTIONS BY APPOINTMENT ONLY- Call 563-382-3753\nSimple Drivers License renewals can be done on-line at mymvd.iowadot.gov\nNote: For vehicle title transfers, buyers should check with the County Treasurer’s Office to make sure the proper documents are available from the seller before a purchase is made. A signed bill of sale is required from the seller.\n[[[\"Transaction\",\" Hours\"],[\"General Office Hours\",\"8:00 - 4:00, Monday - Friday\"],[\"Driver License\",\"8:00 - 4:00, Monday - Friday by appointment only\"],[\"Driver License Knowledge (written) Tests\",\"8:00 - 3:30, Monday - Friday by appointment only\"],[\"Car Drive Tests (behind the wheel)\",\"By appointment\"]],[{\"row\":0,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":0,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"},\"borders\":{\"className\":\"border_row0col0\",\"border\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\",\"cornerVisible\":false},\"row\":0,\"col\":0,\"top\":{\"hide\":true},\"right\":{\"hide\":true},\"bottom\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\"},\"left\":{\"hide\":true}}},{\"row\":0,\"col\":1,\"visualRow\":0,\"visualCol\":1,\"prop\":1,\"jtcellstyle\":{\"font-weight\":\"bold\"},\"borders\":{\"className\":\"border_row0col1\",\"border\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\",\"cornerVisible\":false},\"row\":0,\"col\":1,\"top\":{\"hide\":true},\"right\":{\"hide\":true},\"bottom\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\"},\"left\":{\"hide\":true}}},{\"row\":1,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":1,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0},{\"row\":1,\"col\":1,\"visualRow\":1,\"visualCol\":1,\"prop\":1},{\"row\":2,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":2,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0},{\"row\":2,\"col\":1,\"visualRow\":2,\"visualCol\":1,\"prop\":1},{\"row\":3,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":3,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0},{\"row\":3,\"col\":1,\"visualRow\":3,\"visualCol\":1,\"prop\":1},{\"row\":4,\"col\":0,\"visualRow\":4,\"visualCol\":0,\"prop\":0},{\"row\":4,\"col\":1,\"visualRow\":4,\"visualCol\":1,\"prop\":1}],[{\"row\":0,\"col\":0,\"top\":{\"hide\":true},\"right\":{\"hide\":true},\"bottom\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\"},\"left\":{\"hide\":true},\"border\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\",\"cornerVisible\":false}},{\"row\":0,\"col\":1,\"top\":{\"hide\":true},\"right\":{\"hide\":true},\"bottom\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\"},\"left\":{\"hide\":true},\"border\":{\"width\":1,\"color\":\"#000\",\"cornerVisible\":false}}],[]] []\nTransaction | Hours |\nTransaction: General Office Hours | Hours: 8:00 - 4:00, Monday - Friday |\nTransaction: Driver License | Hours: 8:00 - 4:00, Monday - Friday by appointment only |\nTransaction: Driver License Knowledge (written) Tests | Hours: 8:00 - 3:30, Monday - Friday by appointment only |\nTransaction: Car Drive Tests (behind the wheel) | Hours: By appointment |\nFinancial Management Duties\nInvestment of Revenues\nKeep accurate record of monies received and disbursed\nChecking supporting data for all check and cash receipts from all county monies\nSubmit accurate financial records for annual audit\nPrepare monthly reports\nPrepare reports throughout the year for the Winneshiek County Board of Supervisors and State Auditor\nUpdate Investment Report bi-annually\nACH transfers of monthly tax payments\nApportion of taxes to various entities\nCollect miscellaneous revenues from all county offices and departments\nTreasurer\nTimothy N Smock\n201 W. Main Street\nDecorah, IA 52101\nPhone: 563-382-3753\nFax: 563-387-4083\nEmail: Contact\nOffice Hours:\nMonday - Friday 8:00 am to 4:00 pm\nWinneshiek County, Iowa\n201 W. Main Street | Decorah, Iowa 52101 | (563) 382-5085\nPrivacy Policy",
